[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふーむ……見た感じ、いつもと変わんない気がする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... At a glance, everything looks the same as usual."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺たち素人には判断がつかんな。\n暗いから異変があっても見逃しそうだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're just amateurs, so we can't really tell. It's so dark in here that we'd probably miss any abnormalities anyway."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……フフ\n…………ハハハ……\n",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hehe... ...Ahahaha..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、なんだこの声……\n笑ってる、のか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-what's that sound...? Is that... laughter?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "奥から聞こえるよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's coming from deeper inside!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "注意して進もう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's proceed carefully."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やはり人造頂獣の力は素晴らしい！\nこれでここの補強作業も最後です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The power of the man-made Apexi truly is magnificent! With this, the reinforcement work here is finally complete!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヤバい人だ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This guy's dangerous!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今回に限り、リアスの語彙が的確だ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For once, your assessment is spot-on...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おや、どちら様ですか？\nこの鉱山は調査休鉱中なのですが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my, who might you be? This mine is currently closed for investigation."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どちら様ってのはこっちのセリフなんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's our line..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今、補強作業と仰いましたが……\nもしかして国から派遣された調査員の方、ですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You mentioned reinforcement work just now... Are you by any chance the investigator dispatched by the kingdom?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。ワルター・マンと申します。この地でたびたび\n生じている地震の調査に来ました。あなたがたは？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. My name is Walther Mann. I've come to investigate the frequent earthquakes occurring in this region. And you are?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっと……なんて言えばいいんだろ？\nもう錬金術士じゃないし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um... how should I put this? I'm not really an alchemist anymore."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この近くの町、ハルフェンの者です。\n俺はスレイ・クロスリッターで、彼女が……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're from Hallfein, a nearby town. I'm Slade Clauslyter, and she's..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "リアス・アイトライゼだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias Eidreise!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "スレイさんに錬金術士のリアスさん……\nああ、お話はうかがっていますよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade and the alchemist Rias... Ah yes, I've heard about the two of you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしたちのことを知ってる！？\nまたレスナちゃんの情報網！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You know about us!? Is this Resna's information network at work again!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、似たようなものですかね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, something like that, yes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "グルルル……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Grrrrr..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "人造頂獣",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Man-made Apexi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっと……その巨大な獣は？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um... what's with the giant beast?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、これは人造頂獣です。\nこう見えて、大人しくていい子ですよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, this is a man-made Apexi. Despite appearances, it's quite docile and well-behaved."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……噛まない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...It won't bite?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "噛みません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It will not bite."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すり潰さない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It won't crush me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すり潰しません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It will not crush you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか、よかった！\nよろしくね、ゴゴンガ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Okay, that's a relief! Nice to meet you, Gogonga!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ゴ……なんですその名前は",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Go... what kind of name is that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でっかくてゴゴーって感じだから！\n人造頂獣って、呼びにくいし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Because it's big and goes 'gogo!' Plus, 'man-made Apexi' is kind of a mouthful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こら、勝手に名付けたらダメだろ。\n……すみません、彼？\u3000の名前はなんというのですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, you can't just name it without permission. ...Sorry about that. What is his... name, exactly?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いえ、名前は付けていませんでした。ちょうどいい。\n人造頂獣、これからあなたはゴゴンガです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, I hadn't actually given it a name. This works perfectly. Man-made Apexi, from now on you are Gogonga."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいのか……というか、人造頂獣とは……？\nあとその格好……聞きたいことが山ほどあるんですが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that really okay...? Also, what exactly is a man-made Apexi? And that outfit... I have so many questions."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあそれは道すがら話しましょう。\nもう少しで震源を特定できそうなんですよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, let's discuss that as we go. I'm close to pinpointing the earthquake's epicenter."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すごい！\u3000さっすが国からの助っ人！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow, you can do that? Talk about being an expert."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "立場上、これくらいはこなさなくてはいけませんから。\nそれよりも、さて、何から話をするべきか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Given my position, I should at least be capable of this much. Now then, where should I begin..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "限りなく怪しいが、\nロゼと似た苦労人の空気を感じるな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He's extremely suspicious, but I'm getting a vibe similar to Raze... like he's had a lot going on..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この鉱山は個人的にも興味をそそられます……\nああ、隅から隅まで調査し、丸裸にしてしまいたい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This mine is personally quite fascinating to me... Ah, I'd love to investigate every nook and cranny, strip it bare of its secrets..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "またなんかブツブツ言い始めたし。\nやっぱり怪しい人だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There he goes muttering to himself again. He really is a weirdo."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リアス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rias"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "エルといい、学者肌というのは\nどいつも一癖あるんだろうか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "First El, now this... Do all scholarly types have these quirks?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "スレイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slade"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "研究者肌の錬金術士で、元「極夜の錬金党」。\n現在は国の監視下で、研究や調査に協力している",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A research-oriented alchemist and former member of the Polar Night Alchemists. Currently cooperating with research and investigations under the kingdom's supervision."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター・マン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther Mann"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]